Approach :
- A series is given in the form of -1+2-3+4-5+6....
- Task is to calculate the sum upto a given value.
- General process includes the sum of all even integers and subtraction of all odd integers, but it takes up a lot of time, due to lenghty calculations.
- To avoid this, we can use the general formulas as mentioned below based in the n value


CODE :

def functionf1(n):
    if n % 2 == 0:
        print(n // 2)
    else:
        print(-(n + 1) // 2)

n=int(input())
functionf1(n)
